### 1. Thành công Flight + Hotel + Payment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/combo-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUS-001",
  "flightId": "VN123",
  "hotelId": "HTL-001",
  "amount": 3500000,
  "scenario": "SUCCESS"
}

### 2. Flight thành công, Hotel thất bại -> hủy Flight
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/combo-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUS-002",
  "flightId": "VN234",
  "hotelId": "HTL-002",
  "amount": 4200000,
  "scenario": "HOTEL_FAILURE"
}

### 3. Payment thất bại -> hủy Hotel và Flight
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/combo-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUS-003",
  "flightId": "VN345",
  "hotelId": "HTL-003",
  "amount": 5100000,
  "scenario": "PAYMENT_FAILURE"
}

### 4. Hotel phản hồi 5 giây; client timeout 2 giây và retry 3 lần -> rollback
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/combo-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUS-004",
  "flightId": "VN456",
  "hotelId": "HTL-004",
  "amount": 2900000,
  "scenario": "HOTEL_TIMEOUT"
}

